{"id":1047,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><div><p>6月26日下午，我院举办线上明德讲坛，本次讲坛由张煜、赵丹两位优秀毕业生主讲，研一研二全体学生参加。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=2nlnd2nm9bMRLiL-lMVL7LPLlLYL47WaoRlioz9PLlMfn770gihFp2hmCIa0okh7Mkh2LkhVnRUiM8CYU8-ZUzlsnzv4nmliU4ARL4-aoRnFnRA7olVkMR6FMzlPLYb/v2rjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4v4oRlJqdHnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=7385&e=.jpeg\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/8D4F0ED457F2CB8A57E73F55C8C32084/D8D9AB47/5513\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 464px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=2nlnd2nm9bMRLiL-lMVL7LPLlLYL47WaoRlioz9PLlMfn770gihFp2hmCIa0okh7Mkh2LkhVnRUiM8CYU8-ZUzlsnzv4nmliU4ARL4-aoRnFnRA7olVkMR6FMzlPLYb/v2rjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4v4oRlJqdHnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=7385&e=.jpeg\"></p><p>张煜同学围绕省考参公岗位报考、分阶段科学备考规划进行细致讲解，分享了行测与申论分科学习的实用干货；赵丹同学结合自身备考心得，着重提醒大家重视岗位筛选和考场时间分配，并且分享日常素材积累的小技巧以及打造申论亮眼开头、找准适配自身做题节奏的实用方法。</p><p>此次交流为同学们搭建了学习交流平台，两位毕业生贴合自身实战经历分享的备考思路与经验，也有效化解了同学们前期备考的迷茫困惑，为大家长线规划备考、稳步提升应试能力提供了清晰可行的参考。</p></div></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://mkszyxy.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=2nlnd2nm9bMRLiL-lMVL7LPLlLYL47WaoRlioz9PLlMfn770gihFp2hmCIa0okh7Mkh2LkhVnRUiM8CYU8-ZUzlsnzv4nmliU4ARL4-aoRnFnRA7olVkMR6FMzlPLYb/v2rjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4v4oRlJqdHnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=7385&e=.jpeg"}